# Environment files.
#
# Mail credentials are no longer in the client bundle at all: the browser has no
# API key, and the only place RESEND_API_KEY is read is the serverless function
# at /api/send. These values live in the Vercel project's Environment Variables,
# not in a local file. The patterns below stay as a safety net so a local `.env`
# is never committed by accident. `.env.example` IS committed as the template.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Editor directories and files
